OL,3,GNEWSASingle decker bus stolen and
OL,4,Adriven into cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FA single decker bus was stolen in
OL,7,FShropshire after the driver was
OL,8,Fattacked, later crashing into a row of
OL,9,Fparked cars.
OL,11,FVideos posted on social media show the
OL,12,Fdriver being assaulted by a man, before
OL,13,Fhe took over the wheel and drove it
OL,14,Fdown the wrong side of the road,
OL,15,Fcrashing it into multiple cars.
OL,17,FPassengers can be heard screaming for
OL,18,Fhim to stop and urging people to get
OL,19,Fout of the way.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
